## Tag or attribute

`<ui-group>` is a block. `data-ui="group"` keeps its host's display, so use it on a link, a button, or a list item, and stack it on a primitive (`data-ui="card group"`). Descendants read the group's state with the [group modifier](/api/modifiers/group/).

A custom element never matches `:disabled`, so `<ui-group>` takes `aria-disabled="true"` instead, with a role that allows it.

